{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456891-aberrant-fame-and-mega-presence","id":1456891,"title":"[Aberrant] Fame and Mega Presence","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-15T11:47:38-07:00","id":1456891,"title":"[Aberrant] Fame and Mega Presence","content":"Mega Presence gives novas &quot;The benefits of dots in the Fame Edge (Trinity Continuum Core Rulebook, p. 61) equal to the Mega-Presence dots.&quot;<br /> <br /> But fame goes from 1 to 3.<br /> <br /> What happens when you raise Mega Presence to 4?<br /> <br /> Could Aberrant have higher levels of fame? You get enhanced edges?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25829-vjornin","name":"Vjornin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-15T12:10:54-07:00","id":1456895,"title":"","content":"I would go for Fame in a certain field. Fame is a edge that may be bought many times for different fields, so you could be afamou among celebrities or among scientists, or among military. Higher fame values may expand this field or the area where the nova is known, but it\u2019s still kind of focused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-15T12:59:42-07:00","id":1456902,"title":"","content":"The issue with that is that Fame 3 is pretty explicitly worldwide, household name, level celebrity, making other categories a bit superfluous. You can do it as a House Rule, but I don't know what Fame 3 even means in that case.<br /> <br /> Personally, I simplified Mega-Presence to work more like Mega-Manipulation, Mega-Intellect, and Mega-Composure: Instead of the current rules on granting Fame for each level then Followers at 5+, the first dot gives a level of Fame and each dot after that gives you one dot of either Fame or Followers, your choice.<br /> <br /> It's simple and straightforward and allows for high Mega-Presence cult leaders who aren't household names (the Apostle of the Teragen would fall into that category, for example). This is obviously a House rule but I think it's a good one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26949-deadmanwalking","name":"Deadmanwalking","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-15T13:42:36-07:00","id":1456905,"title":"","content":"Fame 3 basically break the idea of the previously 2 dots, but I would keep it focused in a field, even if more generically known, let\u2019s say Einstein has fame 3 among physics students, so people know him in general but have little knowledge of why, it\u2019s more like a example of smart person than anything else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-16T03:55:31-07:00","id":1456947,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Vjornin;n1456891]<br /> What happens when you raise Mega Presence to 4?<br /> <br /> /QUOTE]<br /> <br /> Then you become well known on other human worlds in space, then among alien species. <br /> <br /> Think of it as a future-proofed advantage for settings where those benefits might apply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-16T06:28:31-07:00","id":1456961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vjornin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456891-aberrant-fame-and-mega-presence#post1456891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What happens when you raise Mega Presence to 4?</div> </div> </div> </div>you &quot;only&quot; get Leadership +Scale 4<b>*</b> (that is, Scale 5!!!) while rolling/using the Presence Attribute.<br /> <br /> <i><b>*</b>EDIT: thank you Deadmanwalking, just fixed the number!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1001,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","user":"Timecrafter","date":".  fixed the numbers. :-] 08-16-2021, 04:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-16T12:44:27-07:00","id":1456978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Timecrafter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456891-aberrant-fame-and-mega-presence?p=1456961#post1456961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">you &quot;only&quot; get Leadership Scale 4 (!!!) while rolling/using the Presence Attribute.</div> </div> </div> </div>Scale 5 actually, since you have Scale 1 even without Mega-Presence.<br /> <br /> But it's still weird that Mega-Manipulation always gives a point in an Edge and Mega-Presence is weirdly inconsistent on that score. The two are otherwise equivalent in every way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26949-deadmanwalking","name":"Deadmanwalking","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}